<title>USA: BOXING-NORRIS RETAINS WBC AND IBF JUNIOR MIDDLEWEIGHT CROWNS.</title>
<headline>BOXING-NORRIS RETAINS WBC AND IBF JUNIOR MIDDLEWEIGHT CROWNS.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tennessee 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Terry Norris retained his World Boxing Council and International Boxing Federation junior middleweight titles on Saturday when the referee stopped the fight with Canadian challenger Nick Rupa at 2:34 of 10th round.</p>
</text>
